#: src/signature-editor.vala:150
msgid ""
"Each account has its own signatures. Star the one that should be added to "
"new messages. You can still pick another signature while writing."
msgstr ""
"Κάθε λογαριασμός έχει τις δικές του υπογραφές. Βάλτε αστέρι σε αυτήν που θα "
